* Being drafted by the Steelers in 2004
* Setting an NFL record for most consecutive wins by a rookie quarterback (13-0)
* Earning the AP NFL Offensive Rookie of the Year Award in 2004
* Being selected to his first Pro Bowl in 2007
* Leading the Steelers to a Super Bowl victory in his second season
* Making a cameo appearance as a member of the Gotham Rogues football team in the 2012 film "The Dark Knight Rises"
